<title>USA: Chittenden Corp Q3 shr rises to $0.55.</title>
<headline>Chittenden Corp Q3 shr rises to $0.55.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Vt. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.55		    $0.52</p>
<p> Net			  6,877		    6,440</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  12,490		   12,323</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.57		    $1.46</p>
<p> Net			 19,587		   17,488</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  12,452		   12,052</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 net interest income: $21.1 million vs $20.4 million.</p>
<p>Q3 provision for possible loan losses: $850,000 vs $1.4 million.</p>
<p>Nine month net interest income: $61.8 million vs $57.7 million.</p>
<p>Nine month provision for possible loan losses: $2.9 million vs $3.4 million.</p>
<p>Total assets as of Sept. 30, 1996: $1.97 billion.</p>
<p>Net loans as of Sept. 30, 1996: $1.26 billion.</p>
<p>Total deposits as of Sept. 30, 1996: $1.70 billion.</p>
